    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, but I'm looking for your professional assessment rather than just a checklist of what to look for. I've skimmed the preliminary geological survey and it mentions some concerns about soil stability and potential liquefaction in the lower strata. Is that something that actually poses a dealbreaker for a development of this scale, or is it just standard technical stuff that can be managed with proper engineering?",
